    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: '1280px', height: '720px' }}>
        <svg width='1280' height='720' viewBox='0 0 1280 720'>
            <rect x='64' y='96' width='548' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='64' y='96' width='548' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='82' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.3 request.user：每个请求自带的「当前用户」</text><text x='82' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· Django 给每一个请求都挂上一个 user 对象，视图里直接用 request.user…</text><text x='82' y='197.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 这就是导航栏「已登录显示问候语、未登录显示登录链接」的实现——同一个变量，</text><text x='82' y='217.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>两种身份，模板自己判断。</text><text x='82' y='245.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 实跑输出里 alice 那行是 is_authenticated=True pk=1…</text><rect x='668' y='96' width='548' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='668' y='96' width='548' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='686' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.4 登录、注销、注册三件套</text><text x='686' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 登录和注销不用自己写视图</text><text x='686' y='197.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 注册页面 Django 不提供，得自己写</text><rect x='64' y='574' width='1152' height='66' rx='12' fill='#EEF5FB' /><text x='84' y='616' fontSize='14' fill='#243444' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>看不懂的地方先回讲义对应小节读一遍，再回来对着这页复述一次——能讲出来才算真懂。</text>
